      "sprk_classificationcue": "Fallback classification for any agreement that is clearly a contract between parties creating enforceable obligations, but whose primary subject matter does not clearly match one of the specific registered sub-domains (nda, employment, lease, asset-purchase, services, licensing, vendor, partnership, loan). Use for settlement agreements, novel or hybrid arrangements, multi-subject documents with no single dominant type, or any agreement type not yet given its own registry row. This is the deliberately lower-value, broad-guidance fallback -- never prefer it over a specific sub-domain whose distinguishing characteristics are actually present in the document.",
